{"id":14,"slug":"14-custom-data-attribute-data-trong-html-la-gi","category":"HTML","subcategory":"Nhập Môn","level":"beginner","question_vi":"Custom data attribute (data-*) trong HTML là gì?","question_en":"What are custom data attributes (data-*)?","answer_vi":"`data-*` cho phép gắn dữ liệu tuỳ ý lên element mà **vẫn hợp lệ theo HTML spec** (dùng attribute tự chế như `userid=\"123\"` thì không).\n\n```html\n<li data-user-id=\"123\" data-role=\"admin\" data-active>Định</li>\n```\n\n```js\nconst li = document.querySelector('li')\nli.dataset.userId   // '123'  — kebab-case tự đổi sang camelCase\nli.dataset.role     // 'admin'\nli.dataset.userId = '456'      // ghi ngược lại DOM\ndelete li.dataset.role         // gỡ attribute\n```\n\nDùng được cả trong CSS:\n\n```css\nli[data-role=\"admin\"] { font-weight: 700; }\nli[data-active] { color: var(--accent); }\n```\n\nỨng dụng thực tế: gắn hook cho test (`data-testid`), truyền id xuống event delegation, đánh dấu state cho CSS thay vì thêm/bớt class.\n\n**Lưu ý:** `dataset` **luôn trả string** — `Number(li.dataset.userId)` chứ đừng so sánh thẳng với số. Và đừng nhét dữ liệu nhạy cảm vào đây: nó nằm nguyên trong HTML gửi về client.","answer_en":"`data-*` lets you attach arbitrary data to an element while **staying valid per the HTML spec** (an invented attribute such as `userid=\"123\"` is not).\n\n```html\n<li data-user-id=\"123\" data-role=\"admin\" data-active>Dinh</li>\n```\n\n```js\nconst li = document.querySelector('li')\nli.dataset.userId   // '123'  — kebab-case becomes camelCase\nli.dataset.role     // 'admin'\nli.dataset.userId = '456'      // writes back to the DOM\ndelete li.dataset.role         // removes the attribute\n```\n\nIt also works from CSS:\n\n```css\nli[data-role=\"admin\"] { font-weight: 700; }\nli[data-active] { color: var(--accent); }\n```\n\nReal uses: test hooks (`data-testid`), carrying an id for event delegation, expressing state for CSS instead of toggling classes.\n\n**Note:** `dataset` **always returns strings** — wrap with `Number()` rather than comparing to a number directly. And never put sensitive data there: it ships verbatim in the HTML.","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>data-*</code> cho phép gắn dữ liệu tuỳ ý lên element mà <strong>vẫn hợp lệ theo HTML spec</strong> (dùng attribute tự chế như <code>userid=\"123\"</code> thì không).</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;li data-user-id=&quot;123&quot; data-role=&quot;admin&quot; data-active&gt;Định&lt;/li&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-user-id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;123&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;admin&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-active</span>&gt;</span>Định<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const li = document.querySelector('li')\nli.dataset.userId   // '123'  — kebab-case tự đổi sang camelCase\nli.dataset.role     // 'admin'\nli.dataset.userId = '456'      // ghi ngược lại DOM\ndelete li.dataset.role         // gỡ attribute\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> li = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">querySelector</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;li&#x27;</span>)\nli.<span class=\"hljs-property\">dataset</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">userId</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;123&#x27;  — kebab-case tự đổi sang camelCase</span>\nli.<span class=\"hljs-property\">dataset</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">role</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;admin&#x27;</span>\nli.<span class=\"hljs-property\">dataset</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">userId</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;456&#x27;</span>      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// ghi ngược lại DOM</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">delete</span> li.<span class=\"hljs-property\">dataset</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">role</span>         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// gỡ attribute</span></code></pre></div><p>Dùng được cả trong CSS:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"li[data-role=&quot;admin&quot;] { font-weight: 700; }\nli[data-active] { color: var(--accent); }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">li</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-attr\">[data-role=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;admin&quot;</span>]</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-weight</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">700</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">li</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-attr\">[data-active]</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">var</span>(--accent); }</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Ứng dụng thực tế: gắn hook cho test (<code>data-testid</code>), truyền id xuống event delegation, đánh dấu state cho CSS thay vì thêm/bớt class.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> <code>dataset</code> <strong>luôn trả string</strong> — <code>Number(li.dataset.userId)</code> chứ đừng so sánh thẳng với số. Và đừng nhét dữ liệu nhạy cảm vào đây: nó nằm nguyên trong HTML gửi về client.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>data-*</code> lets you attach arbitrary data to an element while <strong>staying valid per the HTML spec</strong> (an invented attribute such as <code>userid=\"123\"</code> is not).</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;li data-user-id=&quot;123&quot; data-role=&quot;admin&quot; data-active&gt;Dinh&lt;/li&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-user-id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;123&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;admin&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">data-active</span>&gt;</span>Dinh<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">li</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const li = document.querySelector('li')\nli.dataset.userId   // '123'  — kebab-case becomes camelCase\nli.dataset.role     // 'admin'\nli.dataset.userId = '456'      // writes back to the DOM\ndelete li.dataset.role         // removes the attribute\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> li = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">querySelector</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;li&#x27;</span>)\nli.<span class=\"hljs-property\">dataset</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">userId</span>   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;123&#x27;  — kebab-case becomes camelCase</span>\nli.<span class=\"hljs-property\">dataset</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">role</span>     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// &#x27;admin&#x27;</span>\nli.<span class=\"hljs-property\">dataset</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">userId</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;456&#x27;</span>      <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// writes back to the DOM</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">delete</span> li.<span class=\"hljs-property\">dataset</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">role</span>         <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// removes the attribute</span></code></pre></div><p>It also works from CSS:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"li[data-role=&quot;admin&quot;] { font-weight: 700; }\nli[data-active] { color: var(--accent); }\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">li</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-attr\">[data-role=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;admin&quot;</span>]</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-weight</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">700</span>; }\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">li</span><span class=\"hljs-selector-attr\">[data-active]</span> { <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">var</span>(--accent); }</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Real uses: test hooks (<code>data-testid</code>), carrying an id for event delegation, expressing state for CSS instead of toggling classes.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Note:</strong> <code>dataset</code> <strong>always returns strings</strong> — wrap with <code>Number()</code> rather than comparing to a number directly. And never put sensitive data there: it ships verbatim in the HTML.</p>","references":[{"label":"MDN — Using data attributes","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn_web_development/Howto/Solve_HTML_problems/Use_data_attributes"},{"label":"MDN — HTMLElement.dataset","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLElement/dataset"}],"related":[{"url":"/q/3-the-doctype-la-gi-tai-sao-can-khai-bao-doctype","title":"Thẻ DOCTYPE là gì? Tại sao cần khai báo DOCTYPE?"},{"url":"/q/4-cau-truc-co-ban-cua-mot-tai-lieu-html-bao-gom-nhung-gi","title":"Cấu trúc cơ bản của một tài liệu HTML bao gồm những gì?"},{"url":"/q/8-block-level-element-va-inline-element-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao-trong-html","title":"Block-level element và Inline element khác nhau như thế nào trong HTML?"},{"url":"/q/12-html-attribute-thuoc-tinh-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"HTML Attribute (thuộc tính) là gì? Cho ví dụ?"},{"url":"/q/13-boolean-attribute-trong-html-la-gi-cho-vi-du","title":"Boolean attribute trong HTML là gì? Cho ví dụ?"},{"url":"/q/15-thuoc-tinh-id-va-class-khac-nhau-nhu-the-nao","title":"Thuộc tính `id` và `class` khác nhau như thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/16-semantic-html-la-gi-tai-sao-quan-trong","title":"Semantic HTML là gì? Tại sao quan trọng?"},{"url":"/q/17-su-khac-biet-giua-div-va-section-la-gi","title":"Sự khác biệt giữa `<div>` và `<section>` là gì?"}]}